---
<section class="page-gutter pb-[var(--space-3xl)] pt-[calc(var(--nav-h)+var(--space-3xl))]" aria-label="ALTR Matcha Cafe">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-[var(--content-max)]">
    <p class="eyebrow fade-up">Specialty matcha · est. 2026</p>

    <h1 class="display fade-up mt-[var(--space-lg)] flex items-baseline text-[var(--text-display)] italic leading-[0.92] tracking-[-0.02em]">
      <span class="text-ink">ALTR</span><span class="text-accent">.</span>
    </h1>

    <div class="fade-up mt-[var(--space-2xl)] grid grid-cols-1 gap-[var(--space-xl)] border-t border-border pt-[var(--space-lg)] min-[800px]:grid-cols-[1fr_auto] min-[800px]:items-end">
      <p class="max-w-[36rem] text-[var(--text-xl)] leading-[1.25] text-ink">
        Single-cultivar &amp; carefully blended matchas,<br />
        sourced direct from Japanese farms.
      </p>
      <div class="mono flex items-center gap-[var(--space-md)] text-[var(--text-xs)] uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-ink-muted min-[800px]:justify-end" aria-hidden="true">
        <span>Scroll for the menu</span>
        <span class="block h-px max-w-[12rem] flex-1 bg-sand"></span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
